# Zerodrag Strix H7 & Matek H743 Port Mapping (ArduPilot)

| Board Silk Screen Label | ArduPilot Parameter | Default / Recommended Purpose | Special Hardware Notes |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| USB Port | SERIAL0 | System Console / Mission Planner | Direct connection to PC workstation |
| UART7 (T7 / R7) | SERIAL1 | Telemetry 1 (GCS Telemetry Radio) | Includes CTS/RTS hardware flow control lines |
| UART1 (T1 / R1) | SERIAL2 | Telemetry 2 / Companion Computer | Clean DMA-capable high-speed port |
| UART2 (T2 / R2) | SERIAL3 | GPS 1 (Primary Compass/GNSS) | Clean DMA-capable standard navigation port |
| UART3 (T3 / R3) | SERIAL4 | GPS 2 / Auxiliary Peripherals | General purpose hardware UART |
| UART8 (T8 / R8) | SERIAL5 | ESC Telemetry / User Peripherals | General purpose hardware UART |
| UART4 (T4 / R4) | SERIAL6 | VTX Control / Peripherals | General purpose hardware UART |
| UART6 (TX6 / RX6) | SERIAL7 | RC Input (ELRS / CRSF / SBUS) | Requires BRD_ALT_CONFIG = 1 to free the RX6 trace |

## Quick Protocol Configuration Reference (SERIALx_PROTOCOL)
Assign these numeric values to your chosen SERIAL parameter to set the port's function:

* -1 = Disabled
* 1  = MAVLink 1
* 2  = MAVLink 2 (Default for Telemetry links)
* 5  = GPS / GNSS
* 16 = ESC Telemetry (RPM / Temperature data filtering)
* 23 = RC Input (Required for ExpressLRS in CRSF Mode)
* 42 = DisplayPort (Required for DJI OSD / Walksnail / HDZero video links)
